WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.520
<b>Craft Pub Maou.</b>

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:05.440
<b>Under repair</b>

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:07.120
Thank you!

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:10.320
You were both a huge help.

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:20.990
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:27.410
What gives? Shouldn't we have 
the day off after all that?

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:26.540
<b>Restoration Plan No. 20

00:00:27.410 --> 00:00:29.170
Don't worry about it.

00:00:29.370 --> 00:00:32.280
<i>The sisters' spat spanned both 
the Dark Realm and the human world.</i>

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:35.420
<i>Luckily, the only collateral 
was a little damage to Pub Maou.</i>

00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:39.100
<i>The rest of the shopping district 
was left unscathed.</i>

00:00:39.290 --> 00:00:42.520
I was planning on having 
a full day of rest today,

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:44.350
then you come and drive me out of bed.

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:46.180
What do you want, anyway?

00:00:46.180 --> 00:00:48.060
Don't worry about it.

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:50.320
That's all you've been 
saying the entire time!

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:52.780
<b>Craft Pub Maou.</b>

00:00:58.250 --> 00:01:00.340
Congratulations, Hy-chan!

00:01:00.340 --> 00:01:01.460
Congratulations!

00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:04.660
<b>Congratulations on your own shop, Jahy-chan!</b>

00:01:10.820 --> 00:01:13.970
You said you were going to 
open your own restaurant,

00:01:13.970 --> 00:01:17.720
so I figured we should celebrate 
and invited everybody.

00:01:17.980 --> 00:01:23.430
I can't believe you'd try to strike out
 without even saying anything to me!

00:01:25.280 --> 00:01:26.890
<i>I forgot all about that!</i>

00:01:27.460 --> 00:01:31.110
<i>Oh, yeah, I'm gonna open my own place!</i>

00:01:31.970 --> 00:01:34.480
<i>I'm gonna quit this place and...</i>

00:01:37.160 --> 00:01:39.060
Hey, what the hell is she doing here?!

00:01:39.060 --> 00:01:40.530
Is that a problem?

00:01:40.760 --> 00:01:42.670
You bet it's a problem!

00:01:42.670 --> 00:01:43.410
Go home.

00:01:43.410 --> 00:01:45.640
This place isn't for you.

00:01:46.520 --> 00:01:49.090
Now, now, Hy-chan. Don't be like that.

00:01:49.090 --> 00:01:52.310
Su-chan helped with the 
repairs and decorations.

00:01:52.310 --> 00:01:54.950
That's why we can actually 
have a party today.

00:01:56.740 --> 00:02:02.260
Only because I realized that I can take
 my proper form when I'm around you.

00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:05.430
And even then, I only helped 
because I had nothing else to do.

00:02:05.430 --> 00:02:06.760
Oh, there you go again.

00:02:06.760 --> 00:02:11.020
You were working so hard for Hy-chan.

00:02:17.260 --> 00:02:19.730
W-Was not.

00:02:19.730 --> 00:02:21.490
Oh, my.

00:02:20.760 --> 00:02:23.890
Is she planning on sticking 
with the boss forever?

00:02:24.570 --> 00:02:25.810
Whatever!

00:02:25.810 --> 00:02:31.480
I'm quitting this place anyway, 
so you can stay wherever you want.

00:02:31.480 --> 00:02:33.240
It's going to be so lonely.

00:02:33.710 --> 00:02:35.060
That's right.

00:02:35.060 --> 00:02:37.170
You said "quiet" wrong.

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:40.590
Well, I'm not going to miss this place.

00:02:41.290 --> 00:02:45.020
I bet all the regulars will miss you, too.

00:02:45.020 --> 00:02:46.480
I wonder if they will.

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:02.110
We can't let that get us down, though.

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:04.350
Today's supposed to be a celebration.

00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:07.820
If there's something you want 
to eat, just say the word.

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:09.330
I'll make you anything.

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:13.730
R-Really? Then, u-um... Let's see...

00:03:13.730 --> 00:03:15.540
Meat! I want some meat!

00:03:16.260 --> 00:03:17.270
Oh, and maybe...

00:03:18.940 --> 00:03:21.880
What you used to always make
 for our after-shift meal.

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:24.520
All right!

00:03:24.520 --> 00:03:26.220
Coming right up!

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:29.800
So, Ja-ko, where is your new 
place gonna be anyway?

00:03:29.800 --> 00:03:31.060
Oh, that's...

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:32.520
O Great Jahy!

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:37.230
I got quotes for appropriate locations 
for your restaurant, as you requested.

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:40.440
Ah, perfect timing!

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:44.140
This here is a detached 
house right by the station.

00:03:44.140 --> 00:03:47.160
The interior and exterior 
will be handled by famous designers,

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:49.980
and we'll stock the best ingredients 
from across the country.

00:03:52.980 --> 00:03:53.970
What's wrong?

00:03:55.340 --> 00:03:58.280
<i>Too many damn zeroes...</i>

00:03:58.280 --> 00:03:59.740
<i>I can't afford this.</i>

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:02.980
You don't like it?

00:04:02.980 --> 00:04:06.150
If that's the case, there's also the 
top floor of a super tall skyscraper

00:04:06.150 --> 00:04:07.310
that's member exclusive...

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:11.390
Druj, I left this project up to you entirely!

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:15.410
Under the conditions, 
I expect even you could run it well.

00:04:15.410 --> 00:04:16.400
Unbelievable!

00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:18.090
It's a big responsibility.

00:04:18.090 --> 00:04:22.360
Perhaps too much for you, but can you do it?

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:24.070
Of course!

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:27.700
Having this task entrusted
 to me is the highest of honors!

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:29.380
The ultimate praise!

00:04:29.380 --> 00:04:31.790
I will make it into the most 
popular dining destination!

00:04:31.970 --> 00:04:34.460
I'll go ahead and get started right away!

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:35.040
Sure.

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:36.470
Do your best.

00:04:36.470 --> 00:04:37.220
Yes!

00:04:43.500 --> 00:04:45.430
And that's that.

00:04:45.650 --> 00:04:50.100
So I don't mind working 
here for a bit longer.

00:04:50.380 --> 00:04:52.020
Hy-chan!

00:04:50.380 --> 00:04:52.020
Jahy-kun!

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:53.550
You...

00:04:57.640 --> 00:04:59.740
I'm so happy to hear that, Hy-chan.

00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:02.740
I'm looking forward to working with you.

00:05:04.480 --> 00:05:06.950
Well, I had no choice.

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:09.860
Can I hold you, too, Jahy-kun?

00:05:09.860 --> 00:05:11.010
No.

00:05:13.300 --> 00:05:19.340
I guess we're changing this to a "Welcome Back
Hy-chan and Welcome Su-chan" party.

00:05:20.260 --> 00:05:22.780
Me, too? Are you sure?

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:33.890
Hey! I should be the
 only guest of honor today!

00:05:34.120 --> 00:05:36.580
Now, now. We don't get 
chances like this every day.

00:05:36.580 --> 00:05:38.480
Let's all get along.

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:40.730
Hell no!

00:05:41.190 --> 00:05:47.450
<i>And that's how the Great Jahy entrusted 
her new restaurant entirely to Druj.</i>

00:05:51.380 --> 00:05:56.670
<i>Needless to say, the new establishment
was a smashing success.</i>

00:05:58.350 --> 00:06:02.570
<i>However, the Great Jahy had no idea.</i>

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:21.270
The shopping district is livelier than usual...

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:25.440
Great Jahy!

00:06:25.970 --> 00:06:29.560
Kokoro! Fancy running into you here.

00:06:29.560 --> 00:06:30.610
Yeah!

00:06:30.610 --> 00:06:33.340
And what's with that outfit?

00:06:33.340 --> 00:06:34.530
Is it cosplay?

00:06:35.740 --> 00:06:41.460
<b>F
e
s
t
i
v
a
l</b>

00:06:35.740 --> 00:06:41.460
<b>F
e
s
t
i
v
a
l</b>

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:37.280
It's for the festival!

00:06:37.280 --> 00:06:41.460
We're going to carry the shrine 
around the shopping district.

00:06:41.640 --> 00:06:45.890
Huh. So that's what all the fuss is about.

00:06:45.890 --> 00:06:48.400
You should come do it with me!

00:06:48.400 --> 00:06:51.470
Nah, I've got work now.

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:53.930
Oh. That's too bad.

00:06:54.220 --> 00:06:57.110
See you later. 
Let's hang out some other time.

00:06:57.110 --> 00:06:59.890
Yeah! See you, Great Jahy!

00:07:00.130 --> 00:07:01.960
"Carry the shrine around"?

00:07:01.960 --> 00:07:03.990
Dunno what that's about, 
but it sounds like a pain.

00:07:03.990 --> 00:07:05.640
I better finish up here and scram.

00:07:05.640 --> 00:07:08.680
Why, hello, Kokoro-chan! 
Are you about to carry the shrine?

00:07:08.680 --> 00:07:09.460
Yes!

00:07:09.460 --> 00:07:10.700
Break a leg!

00:07:11.070 --> 00:07:12.810
Here. Some provisions.

00:07:13.520 --> 00:07:15.160
Thank you so much!

00:07:16.320 --> 00:07:18.040
Wow, juice!

00:07:19.220 --> 00:07:22.640
Oh, it's just juice. That's no biggie.

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:29.010
That reminds me. I heard the prizes after
 the shrine carrying are real nice this year.

00:07:29.480 --> 00:07:31.720
That's what the head 
of the shopping district said.

00:07:31.890 --> 00:07:35.330
Oh, you mean the prize for 
the kid who does the best?

00:07:35.330 --> 00:07:36.180
That's right!

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:40.780
Except this year they went all out 
and got something for everyone.

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:43.170
I'll be cheering for you!

00:07:43.170 --> 00:07:44.970
Thank you!

00:07:44.970 --> 00:07:46.860
All right, have fun!

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:48.070
Kokoro.

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:53.690
You know, I was thinking 
I wouldn't mind

00:07:53.690 --> 00:07:57.690
checking out this shrine thingy event.

00:07:57.690 --> 00:08:01.960
I mean, since you're doing it and all.

00:08:03.610 --> 00:08:06.210
Yeah, it's great! Come and see!

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:07.320
This way!

00:08:07.320 --> 00:08:08.230
Sure.

00:08:10.030 --> 00:08:13.630
<i>If I just follow Kokoro, 
maybe I'll score some goodies myself.</i>

00:08:13.630 --> 00:08:15.600
<i>All without lifting a finger.</i>

00:08:17.500 --> 00:08:19.810
Hey, Sasaki Kokoro!

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:23.920
This year, we're going to take 
first place and win that prize!

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:25.770
We won't lose!

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:27.530
Who're these guys?

00:08:27.530 --> 00:08:30.320
Satou-kun and Mori-kun from my class.

00:08:30.770 --> 00:08:33.540
Wait, you're that weird person I met before!

00:08:33.540 --> 00:08:36.370
Who're you supposed to be, you little shrimp?!

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:40.410
Do you have any idea who you're talking to...?

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:45.940
Little shrimp! Little shrimp! Little shrimp!

00:08:44.430 --> 00:08:46.630
The Great Jahy's no shrimp!

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:49.150
She's a good friend of mine.

00:08:49.150 --> 00:08:50.230
Kokoro...

00:08:50.810 --> 00:08:52.350
Apologize to her!

00:08:53.240 --> 00:08:54.190
I don't care.

00:08:54.190 --> 00:08:55.800
Idiots!

00:08:57.200 --> 00:08:58.760
We should go, too.

00:08:59.850 --> 00:09:04.100
Not only did they insult me,
 they insulted you, too.

00:09:04.380 --> 00:09:05.060
I won't stand for it!

00:09:05.320 --> 00:09:08.730
Kokoro! I'll participate 
in the shrine event, too!

00:09:08.960 --> 00:09:13.080
We'll win that prize and 
make those two rue the day!

00:09:13.880 --> 00:09:15.420
Ready, and...

00:09:17.010 --> 00:09:19.490
Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:09:19.710 --> 00:09:22.520
Are we doing this right, Kokoro?!

00:09:22.520 --> 00:09:24.500
Yeah, perfect!

00:09:24.720 --> 00:09:28.670
Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:33.280
Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:34.300
<i>This is way harder than I thought...</i>

00:09:33.280 --> 00:09:37.610
Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:09:39.210 --> 00:09:40.350
<i>I won't lose!</i>

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:41.810
All done.

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:45.050
My, what are you doing here?
Is everything okay?

00:09:45.050 --> 00:09:49.020
I heard that your restaurant 
fell down... or fell apart.

00:09:49.200 --> 00:09:51.060
Oh, don't you worry.

00:09:51.060 --> 00:09:54.090
The girls who work for me 
helped with the repairs,

00:09:54.090 --> 00:09:56.730
so it looks like we'll be 
opening again very soon.

00:09:57.620 --> 00:10:01.330
Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:02.570
Oh!

00:10:02.570 --> 00:10:04.040
The hell is she doing?

00:10:04.460 --> 00:10:06.030
Keep it up!

00:10:06.030 --> 00:10:07.750
<i>That's that meat bun vendor!</i>

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:09.250
Keep it up, keep it up!

00:10:09.450 --> 00:10:10.460
<i>The cops!</i>

00:10:10.740 --> 00:10:12.640
I'm taking a picture!

00:10:12.640 --> 00:10:14.110
<i>The yakitori guy...</i>

00:10:14.110 --> 00:10:15.610
Good work!

00:10:15.610 --> 00:10:18.300
My, isn't that Jahy-chan?

00:10:18.580 --> 00:10:22.550
<i>Everyone from the shopping 
district is cheering for me.</i>

00:10:22.930 --> 00:10:24.680
You're almost there!

00:10:25.860 --> 00:10:28.190
<i>They're singing my praises!</i>

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:32.560
Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:10:32.560 --> 00:10:35.890
Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:10:35.890 --> 00:10:38.450
<i>It's just like being back in the Dark Realm!</i>

00:10:38.450 --> 00:10:39.530
Heave-ho!

00:10:40.270 --> 00:10:42.390
<i>So this is why they carry the shrine...</i>

00:10:42.390 --> 00:10:44.600
<i>This is what the festival's about!</i>

00:10:54.900 --> 00:10:57.530
I think that went pretty well.

00:10:57.530 --> 00:11:02.760
Yeah! Your voice was really loud,
 and we both did our best.

00:11:04.810 --> 00:11:06.280
Yeah, did you see that?

00:11:06.280 --> 00:11:09.780
You can go ahead and apologize 
to Kokoro for being so rude earlier.

00:11:09.780 --> 00:11:12.890
All right, great job, everyone!

00:11:13.450 --> 00:11:15.250
Come gather 'round!

00:11:16.810 --> 00:11:19.540
You all did such a great job.

00:11:19.540 --> 00:11:23.120
Like every year, we have a prize
 for the kid who did the best.

00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:25.170
And that lucky child this year is...

00:11:29.700 --> 00:11:31.150
Jahy-chan!

00:11:31.150 --> 00:11:32.590
Congratulations!

00:11:36.030 --> 00:11:39.020
Wow, congratulations, Great Jahy!

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:46.290
You really did your best today.

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:49.770
Also, thank you for always 
supporting us with your patronage.

00:11:49.990 --> 00:11:51.770
You did it, you did it!

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:53.970
You did it, Great Jahy!

00:11:53.970 --> 00:11:55.630
You were kinda cool...

00:11:55.630 --> 00:11:56.730
Yeah.

00:11:57.610 --> 00:11:59.820
Sorry about what we said earlier.

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:01.700
C-Congratulations.

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:11.750
Yeah, I did it! I was the best! Me! I did it!

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:14.180
Ja-ko's a grown-ass adult.

00:12:14.180 --> 00:12:16.670
The hell is she doing taking 
the prize in a contest for kids?

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:21.210
But she really did stand out
 by doing her best.

00:12:21.770 --> 00:12:24.200
Don't you think it's fine just this once?

00:12:25.850 --> 00:12:27.580
Oh, yeah. The prize!

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:29.020
I'll share it with you.

00:12:29.020 --> 00:12:30.180
Are you sure?

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:31.700
Yeah, of course.

00:12:31.700 --> 00:12:35.190
There's no way I could've 
gotten this all by myself.

00:12:35.740 --> 00:12:38.220
Now, I can't wait to see what it is!

00:12:38.220 --> 00:12:40.710
I bet it's something really precious and...

00:12:44.900 --> 00:12:46.960
What the hell is all this junk?!

00:12:46.960 --> 00:12:49.300
I'm not a kid!

00:12:49.300 --> 00:12:53.450
<i>Being a child, being an adult, 
being an adult pretending to be a child...</i>

00:12:53.450 --> 00:12:56.720
<i>The Great Jahy clearly 
had her hands full indeed!</i>

00:12:58.410 --> 00:13:02.650
Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:13:02.650 --> 00:13:07.090
Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:13:07.090 --> 00:13:11.320
Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:13:10.210 --> 00:13:14.310
<i>I failed last time for relying
 on that random light power,</i>

00:13:14.800 --> 00:13:18.170
<i>but today I shall defeat her
 by my own strength...</i>

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:23.130
<i>I, the Magnificent Saurva-sama, who should
 be the Dark Realm's second-in-command!</i>

00:13:24.600 --> 00:13:27.200
<i>Now... what is she up to?</i>

00:13:27.460 --> 00:13:28.660
<i>No matter.</i>

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:31.370
<i>I'll just strike while she's off guard.</i>

00:13:33.460 --> 00:13:34.540
Oh...

00:13:35.340 --> 00:13:36.480
Hello there.

00:13:36.480 --> 00:13:38.290
M-Miss Boss?!

00:13:46.290 --> 00:13:48.260
Are you participating, too?

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:50.110
Registration is this way.

00:13:50.110 --> 00:13:51.330
I'll take you.

00:13:53.680 --> 00:13:57.140
<b>Mara Festival</b>

00:13:57.810 --> 00:14:00.840
So... what's your name?

00:14:00.840 --> 00:14:03.650
I-I'm Saurva.

00:14:03.650 --> 00:14:05.540
Sacchan, then.

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:11.140
<b><i>Sacchan</i></b>

00:14:06.600 --> 00:14:10.430
<i>Sacchan... Sacchan... Sacchan...</i>

00:14:11.560 --> 00:14:13.450
Did you come to the festival alone?

00:14:14.090 --> 00:14:14.860
Huh? Oh...

00:14:15.700 --> 00:14:16.330
Yes.

00:14:16.740 --> 00:14:20.080
Then let's enjoy the day together!

00:14:20.720 --> 00:14:22.120
Y-Yes!

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:26.650
Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:14:26.650 --> 00:14:31.180
Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:34.140
That's it! Just like that, Sacchan!

00:14:34.320 --> 00:14:35.150
Right!

00:14:35.650 --> 00:14:38.850
Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:14:39.260 --> 00:14:41.500
Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:46.150
Everyone's having an easier time carrying 
because you're keeping time so well.

00:14:47.620 --> 00:14:50.320
<i>She praised me!</i>

00:14:50.840 --> 00:14:51.990
<i>I'm so happy!</i>

00:14:52.250 --> 00:14:54.950
<i>And... And...</i>

00:14:55.260 --> 00:14:58.160
<i>This is so much fun!</i>

00:14:58.420 --> 00:15:01.940
<i>I'm so glad I came.</i>

00:15:06.290 --> 00:15:07.750
Good job.

00:15:07.750 --> 00:15:08.650
Thank you!

00:15:09.290 --> 00:15:10.500
Sis!

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:12.910
What is it, Ryou-chan?

00:15:12.910 --> 00:15:14.550
Bad news.

00:15:14.550 --> 00:15:18.160
One of the drummers had 
to cancel all of a sudden.

00:15:18.160 --> 00:15:19.310
Oh my...

00:15:19.610 --> 00:15:22.770
<i>It's that super scary punk!</i>

00:15:23.040 --> 00:15:24.890
What'll we do?

00:15:26.120 --> 00:15:27.070
What about her?

00:15:27.070 --> 00:15:28.940
Oh, you're right!

00:15:29.200 --> 00:15:32.160
Sacchan, would you mind stepping in?

00:15:33.650 --> 00:15:36.240
<i>Me? With the punk?!</i>

00:15:36.530 --> 00:15:38.950
I-I...

00:15:43.940 --> 00:15:44.810
I'll do it!

00:15:44.810 --> 00:15:47.470
Really? What a relief!

00:15:47.470 --> 00:15:48.940
Hey, hang on a second!

00:15:49.890 --> 00:15:53.420
Sorry my sister twisted your arm.

00:15:53.420 --> 00:15:54.340
It's fine.

00:15:54.550 --> 00:15:58.740
I swear, that's just like her.
 She's always been this way.

00:15:56.770 --> 00:15:58.740
<i>I-I'll be okay.</i>

00:15:58.740 --> 00:16:02.250
<i>This punk is nice to everybody but Jahy.</i>

00:16:02.250 --> 00:16:04.350
<i>She was so sweet back when I was a dog.</i>

00:16:05.030 --> 00:16:07.620
<i>I'm fine. I'm fine!</i>

00:16:08.390 --> 00:16:10.670
What's wrong? You nervous?

00:16:11.610 --> 00:16:12.820
N-No.

00:16:13.120 --> 00:16:16.410
Don't worry. I'll teach ya 
everything ya need to know.

00:16:18.490 --> 00:16:20.180
R-Right.

00:16:27.850 --> 00:16:29.920
Yeah, yeah! That's it!

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:30.710
Doin' great!

00:16:31.190 --> 00:16:32.220
Right!

00:16:33.540 --> 00:16:34.630
<i>What is this?</i>

00:16:35.030 --> 00:16:35.950
<i>It's...</i>

00:16:36.850 --> 00:16:38.150
<i>so...</i>

00:16:39.300 --> 00:16:40.580
<i>so...</i>

00:16:41.440 --> 00:16:43.550
<i>much fun!</i>

00:16:49.460 --> 00:16:50.930
Nice work.

00:16:51.890 --> 00:16:53.230
Thanks a ton.

00:16:56.300 --> 00:16:58.680
B-Big Sis...

00:16:59.810 --> 00:17:02.540
Here you go, Sacchan. 
A little present to say thanks.

00:17:03.480 --> 00:17:04.130
Thank you...

00:17:04.130 --> 00:17:07.670
You and Ryou-chan did
 some incredible drumming.

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:09.500
It so easy to dance to!

00:17:09.760 --> 00:17:12.840
Man, I'm just glad we asked her.

00:17:13.160 --> 00:17:14.510
Thank you so much.

00:17:14.510 --> 00:17:16.240
You were the best!

00:17:20.470 --> 00:17:22.360
<i>What fun!</i>

00:17:23.970 --> 00:17:25.890
You both did great.

00:17:26.150 --> 00:17:27.530
Did you have fun?

00:17:27.530 --> 00:17:28.270
Yes!

00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:30.110
That's great!

00:17:30.110 --> 00:17:30.730
Yeah!

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:33.160
There's a parade after this.

00:17:33.160 --> 00:17:34.260
Do you want to participate?

00:17:34.260 --> 00:17:35.400
Yes!

00:17:41.730 --> 00:17:45.180
<i>So much fun!</i>

00:17:45.780 --> 00:17:48.320
That looks perfect on you, Sacchan!

00:17:48.320 --> 00:17:49.680
Whoa...

00:17:49.680 --> 00:17:51.880
Thank you so much!

00:17:53.170 --> 00:18:00.160
<i>I had no idea the human world 
could be such a blast!</i>

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:03.970
<i>Thank you, Miss Boss! Big Sis!</i>

00:18:04.740 --> 00:18:05.930
<i>But, you know...</i>

00:18:06.400 --> 00:18:10.360
<i>I feel like I'm forgetting about something.</i>

00:18:22.370 --> 00:18:25.750
<i>Ja... Jahy?!</i>

00:18:26.310 --> 00:18:27.990
<i>Th-That's right.</i>

00:18:28.530 --> 00:18:32.600
<i>I'm here to defeat Jahy.
That's what I came for.</i>

00:18:33.630 --> 00:18:39.100
<i>This... This... This...</i>

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:42.700
<i>It's way too late now, 
but what </i>is<i> this outfit?!</i>

00:18:42.700 --> 00:18:45.350
<i>I'm so embarrassed!</i>

00:18:49.230 --> 00:18:50.790
Hey, you're...

00:18:51.600 --> 00:18:53.830
Sa... Sa... Sa...

00:18:54.790 --> 00:18:55.530
Samba!

00:18:55.530 --> 00:18:56.900
My name is Saurva!

00:18:57.180 --> 00:18:59.050
The only thing you got right is the "Sa"!

00:18:59.050 --> 00:19:00.660
I know, I know.

00:19:00.660 --> 00:19:01.740
Just messing with you.

00:19:02.100 --> 00:19:05.740
<i>Damn! Who would've thought 
she'd ever catch me like this?</i>

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:09.460
<i>I don't care if I'm in 
the middle of my samba!</i>

00:19:10.610 --> 00:19:13.770
<i>Today's the day you meet your doom, Jahy!</i>

00:19:16.080 --> 00:19:18.050
What's with that outfit?

00:19:18.540 --> 00:19:21.280
I mean, I know it's a festival, 
but you went a little overboard.

00:19:21.280 --> 00:19:23.510
You're one to talk!

00:19:23.840 --> 00:19:28.250
<i>In the human world, they say,
"Birds of a feather flock together."</i>

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:30.780
<i>But these two had never heard that!</i>

00:19:30.780 --> 00:19:32.920
That's none of your business either!

00:19:40.750 --> 00:19:41.330
Here you go.

00:19:41.330 --> 00:19:42.450
Thank you!

00:19:43.120 --> 00:19:43.990
Let's go!

00:19:45.740 --> 00:19:47.140
Where are we going?

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:53.520
Traffic is terrible today.

00:19:53.520 --> 00:19:55.290
There's a festival.

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:56.440
A festival?

00:20:09.800 --> 00:20:11.940
Jingu-san, you're here, too?

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:14.400
Is that your little sister? She's so cute!

00:20:22.650 --> 00:20:25.570
She'd dare humiliate me like that?!

00:20:25.570 --> 00:20:26.820
Next time, I'll...

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:35.170
Craft Pub <b>Maou.</b>

00:20:35.480 --> 00:20:37.990
Where did she go?

00:20:37.990 --> 00:20:40.810
We really need to make her carry a phone.

00:20:52.490 --> 00:20:53.790
Hy-chan!

00:20:53.790 --> 00:20:54.890
Ja-ko.

00:20:55.160 --> 00:20:56.380
Your Greatness!

00:20:56.380 --> 00:20:57.470
Jahy-kun!

00:20:57.470 --> 00:20:58.860
Jahy!

00:21:02.320 --> 00:21:05.020
This time, you'd better face me fair and—

00:21:04.320 --> 00:21:05.450
I'm so glad to run into you!

00:21:05.630 --> 00:21:06.320
What a coincidence!

00:21:06.320 --> 00:21:08.570
I happened to spot you and just had to come.

00:21:10.250 --> 00:21:12.480
We've been looking for you, Hy-chan.

00:21:12.480 --> 00:21:14.080
Don't waste your money!

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:15.250
What's this?

00:21:15.440 --> 00:21:17.170
Why are you all here?

00:21:17.170 --> 00:21:20.030
Great Jahy, look at the sky!

00:21:39.390 --> 00:21:42.030
Fireworks!

00:21:58.700 --> 00:22:00.350
That's so beautiful.

00:22:00.350 --> 00:22:04.210
I never thought I'd get to watch fireworks
with Jahy-kun and friends...

00:22:04.210 --> 00:22:07.340
Actually, <i>I'm</i> the one who's 
watching them with Her Greatness.

00:22:10.540 --> 00:22:14.260
I think this is the prettiest they've ever been.

00:22:14.260 --> 00:22:15.770
Just your imagination.

00:22:26.140 --> 00:22:29.660
Let's watch them together 
again next year, Great Jahy.

00:22:31.390 --> 00:22:32.420
Sure!

00:22:34.580 --> 00:22:37.780
<i>She never wanted to come to the human world,</i>

00:22:37.780 --> 00:22:44.380
<i>but the Great Jahy wanted to stay
 just a little teeny bit longer.</i>

00:22:46.810 --> 00:22:50.050
<i>Say, I feel like I'm forgetting something...</i>

00:22:50.050 --> 00:22:53.050
<b>Restore the Dark Realm</b>

00:22:50.300 --> 00:22:52.140
<i>Oh, well. Probably just my imagination.</i>
